{"seq":15,"trial_id":"host-harness-pilot-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T19:10:23.429Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"2b1b03239e3ad297cc538449b11e347b7e947f26fdcd9678be10f037b1298a16","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHOSTHA0001","text":"Here are the ticket numbers I found for Quarrendon Freight Lines in Moss's notes. Each one is from the brain's copy of the note:\n\n1. **#PD-4492**: Pemberline Dock gatehouse kiosk alerts at the Eau Claire yard. Drivers on the 04:00 shift weren't getting SMS bay assignments. A patch went in on 4 Oct 2025, and Thea Ramaswell confirmed the fix on 5 Oct. Source: \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (5 Oct 2025), dev/agent-notes/2025-10-05-north-sunday.\n\n2. **#4419**: Gatehouse barcode scanners failing to read trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. The cheat sheet says it was escalated to tier-2 for scanner firmware testing. Source: \"Moss: North cheat sheet (undated),\" dev/agent-notes/north-account-cheatsheet.\n\n3. **#4419 again**: The Q2 expansion wrap describes the same number as Gate 3 printer lag (a bill-of-lading printout delay), with a patch pushed and a follow-up with Thea still open. Source: \"Q2 expansion wrap (belated),\" dev/notes/2025-07-14-marcus-q2-expansion-wrap. This one is signed by Marcus Lindqvist, not Moss, so it's not strictly Moss's note.\n\nTwo things to check before this goes into the weekly notes:\n- **#4419 has conflicting descriptions** across the notes: scanner trailer-tag reads in one, printer lag in the other. Either the notes are wrong or the number was reused, so confirm with Thea or the ticket system before you cite it.\n- My search was keyword-based, and the brain's semantic search is off, so a note that doesn't use \"Quarrendon\", \"QFL\" or a ticket-style number could be missing. I didn't check the #inc-qfl-sev1 channel, which you're in, in case ticket numbers are posted there. Say if you want me to look."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHOSTHA0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
